    overview_html: `<p><strong>Neverwinter</strong> features lockbox loot boxes costing 3.99 USD per pull, containing cosmetics, pet companions, and occasional gameplay-affecting mounts. The system is notorious among MMO players for predatory monetization—lockboxes frequently contain power upgrades and vanity items in the same loot pool, confusing whether spending is cosmetic or progression-focused.</p><p>High-rarity mounts obtained through lockboxes can provide gameplay benefits like movement speed bonuses, making the system partially pay-to-convenience (faster traversal equals less time grinding). The lack of transparency about which items are cosmetic versus progression-affecting compounds player frustration with the system.</p>`,
