    editorial_html: `<p>Guild Wars 2 is the gold standard for ethical MMO monetization. The complete absence of loot boxes combined with direct cosmetic purchases at transparent prices proves that games can be profitable without predatory randomization mechanics. This should be the model that every MMO aspires to emulate.</p><p>ArenaNet's commitment to this philosophy for over a decade, despite industry pressure and revenue potential of loot boxes, demonstrates that ethical monetization is possible at scale. GW2 generates significant revenue while respecting players, proving that gambling mechanics aren't necessary for profitability.</p><p>Guild Wars 2 is the safe choice for cosmetic spending. Every purchase is transparent and guaranteed. Play GW2 as evidence that predatory loot boxes are a choice, not a necessity. Support ethical gaming by spending on games that respect consumer protection and fair monetization practices.</p>`,
